akerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4095954122,"text":"ええと…そうだ！たしか、理水畳山真君は琥珀を生み出す花を持っていて、侵入してきた悪いやつらを中に閉じ込められるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[722610209]},{"nodeId":722610209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":2897762138,"text":"理理真すごい。悪いやつらを閉じ込めて、璃月を守った。","nextNodeIds":[722610210]},{"nodeId":722610210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":3769191026,"text":"昔、とてもとても悪い緒方の四鬼が森にやってきて、狸たちをいじめた。だから、五百蔵は公家に変身して、彼らに妖狸飯を食べさせた。","nextNodeIds":[722610211]},{"nodeId":722610211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":353169650,"text":"その後、御伽大王と一緒に絵の中に放りこんで封印した。","nextNodeIds":[722610212]},{"nodeId":722610212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":557360418,"text":"へぇ、そんなことがあったのか。それなら、 五百蔵が吉法師の写真を見てあんなにびっくりしてたのも無理ないな。","nextNodeIds":[722610213]},{"nodeId":722610213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":3500271834,"text":"五百蔵は璃月を守る仙人じゃない。でも、五百蔵は森と狸たちを守る。","nextNodeIds":[722610214]},{"nodeId":722610214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":95209226,"text":"人それぞれ、守るべきものが違うんだ。","nextNodeIds":[722610215]},{"nodeId":722610215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":2360310450,"text":"ぬ？","nextNodeIds":[722610216]},{"nodeId":722610216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1690951114,"text":"大人になれば分かるよ。","nextNodeIds":[722610217]},{"nodeId":722610217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":176822298,"text":"だから、吉法師も頑張って修行して、立派な大妖狸になるんだぞ！","nextNodeIds":[722610218]},{"nodeId":722610218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":1752661146,"text":"ぬ！もちろん。その名もとどろく妖狸吉法師！","nextNodeIds":[722610219]},{"nodeId":722610219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMa