tMapHash":1551936658,"text":"琥珀の中は怖い。暗くて何も見えないし、喋ったり動いたりぽんぽこしたりもできない。石になった感じ。","nextNodeIds":[722610416]},{"nodeId":722610416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":1934060994,"text":"五百蔵は凄いから、石になっても喋ったり見たりできる。ただ動けないだけなの。","nextNodeIds":[722610417,722610420]},{"nodeId":722610417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2351312674,"text":"吉法師は五百蔵を助けたいの？","nextNodeIds":[722610418]},{"nodeId":722610418,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":2732622898,"text":"うん。それと、まだ石の中にいる他の妖狸たちも助けたい。","nextNodeIds":[722610419]},{"nodeId":722610419,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":377338378,"text":"今はオイラたちが傍にいるから、封印されることはないぞ！","nextNodeIds":[722610422]},{"nodeId":722610422,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":2605979818,"text":"イェーイ！","nextNodeIds":[722610423]},{"nodeId":722610423,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1493140986,"text":"でも吉法師はおいたばっかりせずに、ちゃんと人の言うことを聞くんだぞ。","nextNodeIds":[722610424]},{"nodeId":722610424,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":3135526842,"text":"うん。分かった。","nextNodeIds":[722610425]},{"nodeId":722610425,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3329766834,"text":"いい子だ。じゃあ今日はこの辺にして、そろそろ休もうぜ。吉法師もきっと疲れたもんな。","nextNodeIds":[722610426]},{"nodeId":722610426,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":1664363954,"text":"吉法師、疲れてなんかいない！","nextNodeIds":[722610427]},{"nodeId":722610427,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3860933610,"text":"うーん、困ったな。吉法師が言うこと聞いてくれないと、次どこに行けばいいのかオイラ分からなくなったぞ…","nextNodeIds":[722610428]},{"nodeId":722610428,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"「吉法師」","textMapHash":3113282826,"text":"ぬ…","nextNodeIds":[722610429]},{"nodeId":722610429,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":3196350562,"text":"気は進まないようだが、吉法師も疲れを感じてはいるようだ…","nextNodeIds":[722610430]},{"nodeId":722610430,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1780283346,"text":"もう、吉法師は子供みたいだな。","nextNodeIds":[722610431]},{"nodeId":722610431,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":410424650,"text":"パイモンは子供の扱いが上手くなってきてる。","nextNodeIds":[722610432]},{"nodeId":722610432,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1968492850,"text":"そうか？へへ、だてにおまえと長い間旅をしてきてないからな。","nextNodeIds":[722610433,722610435]},{"nodeId":722610433,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":210127906,"text":"#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYFIRST|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLFIRST]}を子ども扱いしてるってこと？","nextNodeIds":[722610434]},{"nodeId":722610434,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3157761978,"text":"そうじゃなくて、オイラたち、色んな子供たちと遊んできただろ？冥ちゃんとか、チャンチャンとか…","nextNodeIds":[722610437]},{"nodeId":722610437,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2362326914,"text":"おまえと一緒に旅をするうちに、色んなことを学べたぞ。","nextNodeIds":[722610438]},{"nodeId":722610438,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4237008498,"text":"今回学んだのは…妖狸と仙人は、気が合わないかもしれないってことだな。","nextNodeIds":[722610439]},{"nodeId":722610439,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1971094490,"text":"よーし、次の目的地を考えないと…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":722610435,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":425681266,"text":"確かに、子供の面倒はたくさん見てきた。","nextNodeIds":[722610436]},{"nodeId":722610436,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":188967650,"text":"うん、色んな子供たちと遊んできたよな。冥ちゃんとか、チャンチャンとか…","nextNodeIds":[722610437]},{"nodeId":72261